  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Hydropower Association - Protocol</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IHA has developed the Hydropower Sustainability Assessment Protocol (&#x201C;the Protocol&#x201D;) in partnership with a multi-stakeholder forum of project developers and operators, regulators, non-governmental organisations, investors and international agencies.
The Protocol is a framework for assessing the sustainability of hydropower projects at four stages of development, and promoting the continuous improvement of hydropower sustainability performance.</narrative>
  </description>
